{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"U23サッカー日本代表優勝おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！45回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nマルコメ・アスンソンさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からみんなで収録しました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の収録かはまだ秘密だけど\nとーっても楽しくて\nたくさん笑った1日でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、純奈と飛鳥ちんと\n夢の国に行く約束もしたよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はやくいけるといいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上さんやみり愛やまたまた飛鳥ちんとも\n大きなテーマパークに行く約束もしてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊ぶ約束がたくさーん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春になったら、テーマパークもいいけど\n山とか登ったり\n丘の上でピクニックしたりしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこか少し遠くに行って\nそこで自転車を借りて知らない道を\n走ったり知らない場所を探検したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね！すごい話しが変わるけど\n前までお風呂に入っても\nあ～～～癒される～～～\nとかなかったけど、\n寒いせいか\n最近、お風呂がリラックスタイムになってね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂場の電気を消して\nお風呂の中にキャンドルを置きたいな！って\n思ってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湯船に浮くキャンドルとかもあるみたいなんだー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度、探しに行ってくる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから家具を調べて見るのにもはまってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいよね～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのリラックスタイムとか\n何かするのにはまってるとか\nあったりしますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊告知です！！！＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎえいご"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↘︎1月31日  23時30分～\nCS放送 TBSチャンネル1 放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマススペシャルの後半戦！！！\nテストの回答をみんなで見たり\n答え合わせしたりと、みんなの珍回答で\nとても面白くなってます！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日放送！！！！  工事中前にみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆なおみちさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ところできいちゃんは人と変わった好きな匂いとかある？？\n僕はガソリンの匂いが好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎変わってるかはわからないけど\n新築の匂いと\n新品の冷蔵庫の匂いはすき！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あひょさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんって二期生にはひなこってよばれてるけど一期生はきいちゃんとひなこどっちがおおいの？～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎蘭世と絢音とみり愛はきいちゃんって呼ぶよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、先輩はきいちゃんが多いけど\n日奈子って呼んで下さる先輩もいます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野って呼ぶのはらりんさんと川後さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野でも、日奈子でも、ひなでも、\nきいちゃんでも、きんちゃんでも、きーでも、\nなんでも嬉しいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あずにゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁女性同士なので（笑）洋服とかメイクとかの話しをしたい！\nそういう質問ってしても大丈夫かな？\n次会えるの4月なんて遠すぎて辛いよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いいね～！！！\nあんまり詳しくないけど、しよしよ♪\n全然大丈夫だよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠いいね～\nでも、楽しみにしてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆かきしゅんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは、ダブルダッチってスポーツ知ってる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎知ってます！！！妹が部活でやってるので、よく動画を見せてもらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縄跳びを使ってあんなことをするなんて\n本当にすごいですよね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できたらかっこいいんだろうな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆きぃくんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは普段自転車とか乗る？\n僕は散歩が好きだからきいちゃんはどうかなー？って思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎自分の自転車は高校3年生から\n乗らなくなってから捨てちゃってないから\nそんなに乗らないよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹の自転車をこの間、\n半年以上ぶりに乗った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自転車って久しぶりに乗ると楽しいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一輪車でもよく、遊んでたな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一輪車したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ジョナサンさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんのさりげない動物アイテムを取り入れたファッションが良いですね！\n今回はウサギさんでしたね！\n次は何かな～？(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎そうなんです！毎回、意識しないでも\n動物が必ずファッションの中に入ってるんです！！！びっくり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、これからは意識して\n小さくてもどこかしらに動物いれていこうかな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いこの時期はペンギンの耳当てが\n大活躍！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はなんだろう～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆タッシーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁春：イチゴ\n夏：スイカ\n秋：柿\n冬：ミカン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎断トツで、夏のスイカ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、秋の柿もすきなんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の秋は柿を毎日食べた！っていうくらいの柿を摂取しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆アシタカさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんちのお風呂の温度は何度ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎42度です！！！\nもう少しあつくしたい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のきいちゃんにきいちゃおう！は\nここで終わりです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやります٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて！ここで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea