raph","text":"➡︎えー！選べないからー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四次元ポケット♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(717)  まさひろさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんのブログが1日の原動力！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そんなことを言ってもらえるなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても嬉しいです！\n明日も書くので見てくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(750)  ゆーまさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎「一期一会」\n出会いは一生に一度。その出会いを大切にしていこうって今日のきいちゃんのブログを読んで改めて思いました！ありがと～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そうですね！！！大切にしていきたいです！大切にしていきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのことが本当に大切で\nだいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1000)  ともかさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎高校に無事合格しました！\n高校生になったら握手会やLIVEに沢山行きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは楽しみです！待ってます♪\n是非、きてくださいね～٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/4998893/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはここまでー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はどなたが、セレクトされるのでしょうか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわくします(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/i